1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,570
Kutton se itna pyaar hai, par usse pet nahi bharta.

2
00:00:03,870 --> 00:00:09,595
Arjun, aajkal log pet ko bachche jaisa rakhte hain! Pet grooming aur pet shop khol!

3
00:00:09,895 --> 00:00:12,892
Kutton ko nehlaane ke paise milenge, uncle?

4
00:00:13,192 --> 00:00:18,915
Achhe paise milenge! Tub, dryer, table aur trimmer, lagbhag 2 lakh ka setup.

5
00:00:19,215 --> 00:00:25,690
Grooming ka course kar, aur jaanwaron se pyaar se pesh aa. Saath mein khaana aur khilone bhi bech.

6
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:30,205
Arjun, mere Bruno ko ekdam hero bana do. Kal uska birthday hai!

7
00:00:30,505 --> 00:00:34,314
Nahaana, baal cutting, naakhoon, sab. 1,200 rupaye, aunty!

8
00:00:34,614 --> 00:00:39,125
Roz 4-5 grooming, aur khaane ki bikri. 5 hazaar tak roz.

9
00:00:39,425 --> 00:00:45,390
Phir ghar jaakar grooming ki van chala. Aur pet hostel bhi, jab log chhutti pe jaayein!

10
00:00:45,690 --> 00:00:48,285
Shauk bana dhandha! Arjun ki life set!
